        "Please refer to page 80 for recipes.",
        "I made this guide to make this transition as convenient as possible, including how much it costs.",
        "To support me, you can click on the Amazon links that I have included below as recommended products to aid in your transition. As an Amazon Associate, I earn from qualifying purchases, which helps fund future e-book guides and research."
